  DEALERDESK QUICK HELP

  - Plates are converted to upper case automatically.
  - Trade customers receive a 5% trade discount.
  - Fleet customers receive an automatic 4% fleet discount.
  - Salesman discounts above 10% require a manager PIN.
  - Quotes are valid for 7 days.
  - A sold vehicle cannot be reserved or sold again.

